    <section>
      <h2>Service description</h2>
      <p>
        PDFTwin is a browser-based document workspace with 18 tools for converting, organizing,
        comparing, and protecting PDFs and related file formats. Tools are grouped into three
        categories:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Convert &amp; export</strong> — PDF to Word or Excel, Word to PDF, image
          conversion, images to PDF, PDF to JPG/PNG, PDF to text, OCR, compress PDF, and resize
          images
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Organize documents</strong> — compare PDFs, merge and arrange, split, extract
          pages, remove pages, and rotate pages
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Protect files</strong> — watermark PDF, lock and unlock, and sign PDF
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Some tools run entirely in your browser; others send files to our servers for processing.
        See our <a href="/resources">How it works</a> page and the Privacy Policy for details on
        where each tool processes data. Features, limits, and tool availability may change as the
        product evolves.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Eligibility</h2>
