        You must be at least 13 years old (or the minimum age required in your country) to use
        PDFTwin. If you use the service on behalf of a business, you represent that you have
        authority to bind that organization to these Terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Accounts</h2>
      <p>
        Most tools work without an account. Creating an account is optional for the Free plan and
        may be required for Pro checkout and plan management. When you register, you provide an
        email address and password through our authentication provider (Supabase). You are
        responsible for keeping your credentials secure and for activity under your account.
      </p>
      <p>
        Account data includes your email address and plan status (Free or Pro). We do not store
